{"id":68304,"date":"2022-02-22T15:48:00","date_gmt":"2022-02-22T14:48:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68304"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:27:41","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:27:41","slug":"corrida-do-bombeiro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-do-bombeiro\/","title":{"rendered":"8\u00aa Generali Tranquilidade Corrida do Bombeiro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">8\u00aa Generali Tranquilidade Corrida do Bombeiro 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>8\u00aa Generali Tranquilidade Corrida do Bombeiro 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>18 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, com tiro de partida marcado para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> (concentra\u00e7\u00e3o a partir das 08:00) junto \u00e0 emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Capela do Senhor da Pedra<\/strong>, na <strong>Alameda do Senhor da Pedra<\/strong>, em <strong>Miramar<\/strong> (<strong>Vila Nova de Gaia<\/strong>). Criada para homenagear a coragem e a dedica\u00e7\u00e3o dos bombeiros \u00e0 comunidade, esta prova matinal combina competi\u00e7\u00e3o em estrada e conv\u00edvio desportivo \u00e0 beira-mar no litoral gaiense.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O evento integra uma <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada (aberta aos escal\u00f5es Seniores e Veteranos 35 a 65) e uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de cariz l\u00fadico aberta a todas as idades. O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 maioritariamente plano, r\u00e1pido e sempre acompanhado pela brisa atl\u00e2ntica da orla mar\u00edtima de <strong>Vila Nova de Gaia<\/strong>: ap\u00f3s a largada em frente \u00e0 praia de <strong>Miramar<\/strong> e ao seu ic\u00f3nico templo hexagonal erguido sobre os rochedos, segues em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 <strong>Aguda<\/strong> contornando a zona do hist\u00f3rico campo de golfe de Miramar, antes de rumar a norte pelas avenidas costeiras de <strong>Francelos<\/strong> e <strong>Valadares<\/strong> e regressar \u00e0 meta na <strong>Alameda do Senhor da Pedra<\/strong>. Podes planear o teu ritmo de prova com a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e explorar outras <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\">corridas de 10 km em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>Eventsport<\/strong> em parceria com os <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Valadares<\/strong> e com cronometragem t\u00e9cnica do <strong>Conselho Regional de Arbitragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Porto<\/strong>, a prova assume uma forte miss\u00e3o solid\u00e1ria: 1,00 \u20ac de cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o reverte diretamente em partes iguais (0,50 \u20ac + 0,50 \u20ac) para a associa\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>The Human Safety Net Portugal<\/strong> e para o projeto <strong>\u00ab\u00c0 Comunidade\u00bb<\/strong>, destinado \u00e0 aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de uma nova viatura operacional de combate a inc\u00eandios para a corpora\u00e7\u00e3o de Valadares.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">18 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Alameda do Senhor da Pedra, Miramar, Vila Nova de Gaia, Porto<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km (Corrida) e 5 km (Caminhada)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Eventsport e Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Valadares<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2h00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/eventsport.pt\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Regulamento-8a-Generali-Tranquilidade-Corrida-do-Bombeiro.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 18 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 12\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (ap\u00f3s 12\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 18 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 9.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 12\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (ap\u00f3s 12\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a 8\u00aa Generali Tranquilidade Corrida do Bombeiro 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, <strong>18 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida \u00fanica \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> (concentra\u00e7\u00e3o a partir das 08:00 e abertura das c\u00e2maras de chamada \u00e0s 08:50). O ponto de partida e chegada situa-se na <strong>Alameda do Senhor da Pedra<\/strong>, junto \u00e0 Capela do Senhor da Pedra, na Praia de Miramar, em Vila Nova de Gaia.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, o percurso e o tempo limite da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 composto por uma <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada por chip (escal\u00f5es Seniores e Veteranos M\/F dos 35 aos 65+ anos) e uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> n\u00e3o competitiva aberta a todas as idades. O percurso \u00e9 plano e desenvolve-se junto ao mar entre Miramar, Aguda, Francelos e Valadares. O tempo limite (cut-off) para concluir a prova \u00e9 de <strong>2 horas<\/strong> ap\u00f3s a partida.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos das fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es online decorrem at\u00e9 \u00e0s <strong>23:59 de 17 de outubro de 2026<\/strong> com tr\u00eas fases de pre\u00e7o: na <strong>Corrida 10 km<\/strong> custam <strong>13,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (at\u00e9 31 de agosto), <strong>15,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (at\u00e9 12 de outubro) e <strong>17,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (ap\u00f3s 12 de outubro); na <strong>Caminhada 5 km<\/strong> custam <strong>8,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (at\u00e9 31 de agosto), <strong>9,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (at\u00e9 12 de outubro) e <strong>10,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (ap\u00f3s 12 de outubro). Tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 poss\u00edvel inscrever-se presencialmente na Eventsport (Canidelo) ou nos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Valadares.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento de dorsais e kits de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do kit de atleta realiza-se no <strong>Museu Ludgero Gaspar<\/strong>, junto ao quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Valadares (Largo Ant\u00f3nio Pereira Tamanco, 140, Vila Nova de Gaia), na sexta-feira, <strong>16 de outubro<\/strong>, das <strong>14:00 \u00e0s 19:00<\/strong>, e no s\u00e1bado, <strong>17 de outubro<\/strong>, das <strong>10:00 \u00e0s 19:00<\/strong>. O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (de uso obrigat\u00f3rio na caminhada), dorsal, medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o, \u00e1gua, seguro desportivo e diploma.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a vertente solid\u00e1ria e quem organiza a Corrida do Bombeiro?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela <strong>Eventsport<\/strong> em parceria com os <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Valadares<\/strong>. Cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui um donativo solid\u00e1rio de <strong>1,00 \u20ac<\/strong>: 0,50 \u20ac revertem para a associa\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>The Human Safety Net Portugal<\/strong> (apoio a fam\u00edlias vulner\u00e1veis com crian\u00e7as at\u00e9 aos 6 anos) e 0,50 \u20ac para o projeto <strong>\u00ab\u00c0 Comunidade\u00bb<\/strong>, destinado \u00e0 aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de uma nova viatura operacional de combate a inc\u00eandios para os Bombeiros de Valadares.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"8\u00aa Generali Tranquilidade Corrida do Bombeiro 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-18\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Alameda do Senhor da Pedra, Miramar\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Gaia\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Eventsport e Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Valadares\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a 8\u00aa Generali Tranquilidade Corrida do Bombeiro 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 18 de outubro de 2026 , com partida \u00fanica \u00e0s 09:00 (concentra\u00e7\u00e3o a partir das 08:00 e abertura das c\u00e2maras de chamada \u00e0s 08:50). O ponto de partida e chegada situa-se na Alameda do Senhor da Pedra , junto \u00e0 Capela do Senhor da Pedra, na Praia de Miramar, em Vila Nova de Gaia.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, o percurso e o tempo limite da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 composto por uma Corrida de 10 km cronometrada por chip (escal\u00f5es Seniores e Veteranos M\/F dos 35 aos 65+ anos) e uma Caminhada de 5 km n\u00e3o competitiva aberta a todas as idades. O percurso \u00e9 plano e desenvolve-se junto ao mar entre Miramar, Aguda, Francelos e Valadares. O tempo limite (cut-off) para concluir a prova \u00e9 de 2 horas ap\u00f3s a partida.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos das fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es online decorrem at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de 17 de outubro de 2026 com tr\u00eas fases de pre\u00e7o: na Corrida 10 km custam 13,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 31 de agosto), 15,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 12 de outubro) e 17,00 \u20ac (ap\u00f3s 12 de outubro); na Caminhada 5 km custam 8,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 31 de agosto), 9,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 12 de outubro) e 10,00 \u20ac (ap\u00f3s 12 de outubro). Tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 poss\u00edvel inscrever-se presencialmente na Eventsport (Canidelo) ou nos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Valadares.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento de dorsais e kits de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento do kit de atleta realiza-se no Museu Ludgero Gaspar , junto ao quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Valadares (Largo Ant\u00f3nio Pereira Tamanco, 140, Vila Nova de Gaia), na sexta-feira, 16 de outubro , das 14:00 \u00e0s 19:00 , e no s\u00e1bado, 17 de outubro , das 10:00 \u00e0s 19:00 . O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (de uso obrigat\u00f3rio na caminhada), dorsal, medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o, \u00e1gua, seguro desportivo e diploma.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a vertente solid\u00e1ria e quem organiza a Corrida do Bombeiro?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Eventsport em parceria com os Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Valadares . Cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui um donativo solid\u00e1rio de 1,00 \u20ac : 0,50 \u20ac revertem para a associa\u00e7\u00e3o The Human Safety Net Portugal (apoio a fam\u00edlias vulner\u00e1veis com crian\u00e7as at\u00e9 aos 6 anos) e 0,50 \u20ac para o projeto \u00ab\u00c0 Comunidade\u00bb , destinado \u00e0 aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de uma nova viatura operacional de combate a inc\u00eandios para os Bombeiros de Valadares.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":535,"featured_media":69571,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-68304","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vila-nova-de-gaia-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-corrida-do-bombeiro.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68304","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/535"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=68304"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68304\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":69572,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68304\/revisions\/69572"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/69571"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/